          "en": "Chad",
          "note": "16 million people"
        },
        {
          "fr": "le Congo",
          "en": "Republic of the Congo",
          "note": "5.5 million people"
        },
        {
          "fr": "la Centrafrique",
          "en": "Central African Republic",
          "note": "4.8 million people"
        },
        {
          "fr": "le Gabon",
          "en": "Gabon",
          "note": "2.2 million people"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s-north-africa-le-maghreb",
      "heading": "North Africa: {le Maghreb}",
      "text": "French is widely spoken beside Arabic, in business, schools and the media.",
      "examples": [
