    {
      "id": "s-the-future-is-african",
      "heading": "French in 2050",
      "text": "Forecasts put French at about 700 million speakers by 2050, mostly because Africa's population is growing.",
      "layout": "plain",
      "examples": [
        {
          "text": "The Democratic Republic of the Congo is expected to have more French speakers than France"
        },
        {
          "text": "French is expected to be the most spoken language in Africa"
